{STEP(2, 'Upload your product', "Once logged in, you will see a button that says 'New Product' or a plus icon. Click it. Select the type of product: choose 'Digital product.' Give your product a name (this is what your buyers will see). Upload your PDF file by clicking 'Upload a file' and choosing your PDF from your computer.", "Write a short description: 2 to 4 sentences explaining what the buyer will receive and what result it creates. Set your price by typing in the amount (for example: 7). Click 'Next' or 'Save' to continue.")}
