{NOTE('A note on Stripe setup', "Setting up Stripe takes about 10 to 15 minutes and may feel slightly technical. If you get stuck at any point, search YouTube for 'How to connect Stripe to Gumroad'. There are many short, clear video guides.", "You can also ask a trusted friend or family member to sit with you for this step. It is a one-time setup. Once it is done, you never need to do it again.")}
