{day_card(1,'TEASE','Let people know something is coming. Build curiosity without revealing everything.',"\"I have been working on something quietly for the past few weeks, designed for people who feel stuck trading their time for money. I will be sharing it on Friday. Stay tuned.\"",'Keep it short. Do not share the price or the link yet.','Your Day 1 post:')}
