{day_card(3,'SOLUTION','Introduce your product by name and describe what it does. Still no link yet. This builds curiosity and warms people up.',"\"What I built is called the 10K Roadmap Workbook. It is a step-by-step guide that walks you through building your first digital product, from idea to your first sale. It is designed for people who are not tech-savvy and do not know where to start. I am releasing it on Friday.\"",'Keep it warm and personal. Write as if you are telling a friend.','Your Day 3 post:')}
