{day_card(5,'REVEAL (LAUNCH DAY)','This is it. Share your product, your price, and your link. Be direct. Be clear. Be proud.',"\"Click the link below to get instant access for $7. You will receive the PDF immediately after purchase.\"",'Your post should include: the product name, who it is for, what they get, the price, and a clear call to action with your Gumroad link.','Your Day 5 launch post (include your link):')}
{day_card(6,'OBJECTIONS','Your readers have questions and doubts. Address the most common ones. Start with: "You might be wondering..."','',"Common objections: 'Is this really for someone like me?' / 'I am not tech-savvy enough.' / 'What if I try and it does not work?' / 'Is $7 really worth it?' Answer each one honestly. If you have a money-back guarantee, mention it here.",'Your Day 6 post:')}
{day_card(7,'LAST CHANCE','Create gentle urgency. Remind people this is the closing day of your launch week.',"\"Last day to grab the 10K Roadmap Workbook at the launch price of $7. After today I will be raising the price. Here is the link: [paste link].\"",'Do not be aggressive or create false pressure. Just be honest: your launch week is ending and you wanted to make sure they saw it before it passed.','Your Day 7 post:')}
