{H2('Your Day-by-Day Launch Guide', 1)}
{STEP(1,'Post your tease and tell 3 people personally', "Post your Day 1 tease on Facebook (or Instagram). Set it to 'Public' before posting. Send a personal message to your first 3 people from your outreach list. Reply to any comments or messages within the same day. Engagement builds momentum.")}
{STEP(2,'Post your story and send 3 more messages', "Post your Day 2 story. This is your most personal post, so do not skip it. Send personal messages to the next 3 people on your list. If someone replies with a question, answer it warmly and honestly.")}
{STEP(3,'Post your solution introduction', "Post your Day 3 product introduction. Continue replying to any comments. Share a comment or post to your Stories if you use Instagram.")}
{STEP(4,'Post your proof and send your final 4 messages', "Post your Day 4 proof. Send your final 4 personal messages. Check your Gumroad dashboard. Even if there are no sales yet, make sure everything still looks correct.")}
{STEP(5,'LAUNCH. Post everything. Your product is live.', "Post your full launch post with the product name, description, price, and link. Pin this post to the top of your Facebook profile so it is the first thing people see. Send a WhatsApp or email to close friends and family saying: 'I just launched something. Would love your support.' Check Gumroad every few hours. The first sale notification will arrive by email.")}
{STEP(6,'Address objections and keep replying', "Post your Day 6 objections post. Reply to every comment and message from the past 24 hours. If anyone asked a question publicly, answer it in the comments. Others will have the same question.")}
{STEP(7,'Final push. Then breathe.', "Post your Day 7 final reminder. Check your Gumroad dashboard one final time. That evening, regardless of how many sales you made, write down what you learned. Every launch is data.")}
